{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7e7396e5-a4a8-8e4f-a507-4abc887454ac",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T14:09:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela E. Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:07:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation department, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:07:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Beth. I'm trying to find out how to book a photo shoot at one of the beaches. Who do I ask about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place. Is it a professional shoot, or more like family pictures?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a small one. A friend of mine takes portraits, and she wants to do a few sessions down by the beach off the boulevard. Maybe five or six people over a morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:08:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. For anything that's commercial or has a few people and equipment, we usually ask for a request first. I can take your details and get the request form started, and it goes to the person who handles beach and park use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:08:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Should I give you my name now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. And a number where we can reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:08:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Daniela Mejia, M-E-J-I-A. The number is 401-555-0168. That's the landline here. I'm at the laundromat, I work the counter, so if it rings and nobody answers, just try again in a few minutes. It gets busy with the machines."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:08:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Daniela Mejia, and I'll note the best time is afternoons. Do you have a date in mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:08:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, probably spring. She's still deciding."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll put down that it's a spring photo session at the beach, a handful of people, and that you want the permission steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Will I need to call back after that, or will somebody call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Someone from the office should call you with the next steps, so you won't need to call again unless you haven't heard anything in a week or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:09:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's clear. Thanks, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:09:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Daniela. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
